      "message": "fix(lnbits): tolerate missing preimage in payment status response\n\nLNbits doesn't always include `preimage` in the payment status payload\n— notably for pending or failed payments, and for some backend\nconfigurations even on settled ones. Direct subscript access raises\n`KeyError` and breaks status polling. Use `.get()` so `preimage` falls\nthrough as `None`, which `PaymentStatus` already accepts.",
      "tree": {
        "sha": "9c421cab5ba6aed12f81f44f20c0f8b7d7b70fd0",
        "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/cashubtc/nutshell/git/trees/9c421cab5ba6aed12f81f44f20c0f8b7d7b70fd0"
